DESCRIPTION >
    Integrations: install-silent check — event count + most recent timestamp,
    trailing 24h, any event type (Promise.all batch). Tenant-scoped; prunes
    via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/routes/integrations.js:113-118 (queryName 'integ_recent').
    Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id. Source has NO
    event_type filter (matches any event) — preserved exactly. No JSON-bag
    fields. IDENTICAL query text to alert_recent.pipe
    (api/routes/alerts.js:102) — duplicate logic, Phase-6 consolidation
    candidate (noted, not acted on).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE integ_recent_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count() AS cnt, MAX(timestamp) AS last_ts
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR

TYPE endpoint
